   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "El futuro: -(으)ㄹ 거예요",
    "@en": "The future: - (으) - 거예요"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "Para hablar de planes, se añade **-ㄹ 거예요** tras vocal o **ㄹ**, y **-을 거예요** tras otra consonante.",
     "@en": "To talk about plans, **-ㄹ 거예요** is added after vowel or **ㄹ**, and **-을 거예요** after another consonant."
    },
    "하다 → **할 거예요**, 가다 → **갈 거예요**, 살다 → **살 거예요**, 먹다 → **먹을 거예요**.",
    {
     "@es": "Sirve para todas las personas y también para preguntar: **뭐 할 거예요?** = ¿qué vas a hacer?",
     "@en": "It serves all people and also to ask: **뭐 할 거예요?** = what are you going to do?"
    }
   ]
